       "id": "6085443",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"dmc-hero\">\n        <div class=\"dmc-wrap dmc-hero__grid\">\n          <div class=\"dmc-hero__main\">\n            <div data-dmc-nuts aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"dmc-hero__strip dmc-hero__strip--top dmc-marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"dmc-marquee__track\" data-speed=\"60\">\n                <span>Best quality products</span><span>✦</span><span>Imported from USA · Australia · Middle East</span><span>✦</span><span>Graded · Sorted · Hygienically packed</span><span>✦</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dmc-hero__content\">\n              <div class=\"dmc-eyebrow\" data-reveal=\"fade\">Best Quality Products</div>\n              <h1 class=\"dmc-h1\" data-split>Supplying the World with the <em class=\"dmc-accent\">Finest</em> Almonds</h1>\n              <p class=\"dmc-lead\" data-reveal>We specialize in premium wholesale almonds sourced directly from trusted farms. With unmatched freshness, rich taste, and global supply capabilities, we ensure your business receives only the best—straight from the orchards to your doorstep.</p>\n              <div class=\"dmc-hero__ctas\" data-reveal>\n                <a class=\"dmc-btn\" href=\"/shop/\" data-magnetic>Explore Varieties <svg class=\"dmc-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\" /></svg></a>\n                <a class=\"dmc-btn dmc-btn--ghost\" href=\"#quote\" data-magnetic>Get Bulk Quote</a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"dmc-hero__trust\" data-reveal>\n                <div><strong>2018</strong><br />Incorporated</div>\n                <span class=\"sep\"></span>\n                <div><strong>9</strong><br />Almond grades</div>\n                <span class=\"sep\"></span>\n                <div><strong>3</strong><br />Sourcing regions</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"dmc-hero__badge\" href=\"/shop/\" aria-label=\"Shop varieties\">\n              <svg class=\"ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <defs><path id=\"dmcCircle\" d=\"M60,60 m-48,0 a48,48 0 1,1 96,0 a48,48 0 1,1 -96,0\" /></defs>\n                <text font-family=\"DM Sans, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"3.2\" fill=\"#4e2320\"><textPath href=\"#dmcCircle\">WHOLESALE ALMONDS • DMC NUTS • </textPath></text>\n              </svg>\n              <span class=\"core\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9\" /></svg></span>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dmc-hero__side\">\n            <a class=\"dmc-promo dmc-promo--green\" href=\"#quote\" data-reveal=\"right\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"tag\">Deal of the day</div>\n                <h3>Discount on Bulk Orders</h3>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"dmc-btn dmc-btn--light dmc-btn--sm\">Request rate</span>\n              <img src=\"/wp-content/plugins/dmc-revamp/assets/img/products/golden-bag-cutout.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" />\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"dmc-promo dmc-promo--brown\" href=\"/product/orange-bag-almonds/\" data-reveal=\"right\" data-delay=\"0.15\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"tag\">Bestseller</div>\n                <h3>Orange Bag · 15 Kg</h3>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"dmc-btn dmc-btn--light dmc-btn--sm\">View grade</span>\n              <img src=\"/wp-content/plugins/dmc-revamp/assets/img/products/orange-bag-cutout.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" />\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>"
       },
       "elements": []
      }
     ]
