        "html": "<section class=\"dmc-section--tight dmc-bg-white\" style=\"border-block: 1px solid var(--dmc-line)\">\n        <div class=\"dmc-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"dmc-head dmc-head--center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 32px\">\n            <div class=\"dmc-eyebrow dmc-eyebrow--center\">Globally certified</div>\n            <h2 class=\"dmc-h3\">Quality you can trust</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dmc-certs\" data-stagger>\n            <div class=\"dmc-cert\"><img src=\"https://dmcnuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/iso.jpg\" alt=\"ISO certified\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><strong>ISO</strong><span>Quality management</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"dmc-cert\"><img src=\"https://dmcnuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/gmp.jpg\" alt=\"GMP certified\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><strong>GMP</strong><span>Good manufacturing practice</span></div></div>\n            <div class=\"dmc-cert\"><img src=\"https://dmcnuts.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/fssi.jpg\" alt=\"FSSAI licensed\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><strong>FSSAI</strong><span>Food safety &amp; standards</span></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>"
