       "id": "8d947d5",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<section class=\"dmc-section\">\n        <div class=\"dmc-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"dmc-head\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"dmc-eyebrow\">Customer reviews</div>\n              <h2 class=\"dmc-h2\" data-split>Trusted by <em class=\"dmc-accent\">retailers</em> &amp; distributors</h2>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dmc-voices\" data-stagger>\n            <figure class=\"dmc-voice\" style=\"margin: 0\">\n              <span class=\"dmc-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg></span>\n              <p>We have been sourcing almonds from this company for over a year now, and the Orange Bag almonds are our best-sellers. The consistency in taste, crunch, and freshness is unmatched.</p>\n              <figcaption class=\"dmc-quote__who\"><span class=\"dmc-avatar\">RP</span><div>Ramesh Patel<span>Retail Store Owner, Ahmedabad</span></div></figcaption>\n            </figure>\n            <figure class=\"dmc-voice\" style=\"margin: 0\">\n              <span class=\"dmc-stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.5 7 .8-5.2 4.8 1.4 7L12 17.6 5.8 21.1l1.4-7L2 9.3l7-.8z\" /></svg></span>\n              <p>The Purple and Pink Bag almonds are absolutely loved by our health-conscious clients. The packaging is not just vibrant but also makes inventory management easier for us.</p>\n              <figcaption class=\"dmc-quote__who\"><span class=\"dmc-avatar\">NS</span><div>Nidhi Sharma<span>Distributor, Delhi NCR</span></div></figcaption>\n            </figure>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>"
       },
       "elements": []
      }
     ]
